Guren and Guren is a jewelry house in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]] and a popular consumer brand. It keeps a public showroom at street level and a private one above it, and its office building climbs ten floors. [[Org/Guren and Guren/People/Amos Guren|Amos Guren]] keeps his own showroom on the ninth.

The house deals in diamonds, gold and platinum work, and rough stones left uncut on purpose. [[Org/Crystal Random/index|Crystal Random]], another jeweler down the street, is its rival, and the two do not deal with each other.
